# Cloudflare Tunnel token for the dashboard-managed tunnel
# (Tunnels → clover-zkong-middleware → Configure → Copy token).
# This is the ONLY credential needed when the tunnel is managed in the
# Cloudflare dashboard (Option A in README.md). Leave empty if you are
# using a locally-managed tunnel via config.yml instead (Option B).
#
# How to get it:
#   1. Create the tunnel in dash.cloudflare.com → Networks → Tunnels
#   2. Copy the token shown under "Install and run a connector"
#   3. Paste it here (starts with eyJhI...)
#
# Do NOT commit the real token — copy this file to .env and keep .env gitignored.
TUNNEL_TOKEN=
